    [CI] Add DeepSeek-V4-Flash Mooncake pooling coverage on A3 (#20215)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    
    Add a single-node Mooncake KV pooling test for
    `Eco-Tech/DeepSeek-V4-Flash-0731-w8a8` and register it in the A3 weekly
    suite.
    
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    
    No. These changes affect E2E tests and CI infrastructure only.
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    
    An earlier revision passed the A3 single-node E2E test:
    
    https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/actions/runs/40832975263/job/123313228597
    
    That run completed both performance stages and GPQA evaluation. Logs
    confirmed a 65536-token external pool load and backend GET activity.
    
    The latest workload and threshold changes still require a CI rerun. The
    earlier result does not validate the final configuration.
    
    ---
    
    - vLLM main:
    https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/commit/544f182d9f0c9bfe8bd7645525951d5e3692a542
    
